<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="zh-Hant"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1414075101"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="930861246"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ハナコトバ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="戸松遥 / 白石晴香 / 三澤紗千香"/><amll:meta key="album" value="俺を好きなのはお前だけかよ ENDING THEME CD ハナコトバ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:00.000"><div begin="00:03.242" end="03:38.962"><p begin="00:03.242" end="00:05.399" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36028">我點解會寫呢一首歌</p><p begin="00:05.926" end="00:08.349" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36029">就係因為我聽太多歌</p><p begin="00:09.206" end="00:10.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36030">尤其是係情歌</p><p begin="00:11.252" end="00:15.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36031">而好可惜根本無一首情歌可以感動到我<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在过于耀眼的阳光的阴影之下</span></p><p begin="00:15.534" end="00:21.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36032">迫返工趕收工我理髮都不理世事<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是无人问津散发着清香的花朵</span></p><p begin="00:22.758" end="00:29.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36033">修修身沖沖身嗱我冇再對花灑亂唱</p><p begin="00:29.501" end="00:32.676" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36034">La, la, la, la, la, la, la, la, la</p><p begin="00:32.686" end="00:36.486" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36035">供車供樓我攰到無火<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多希望你可以注意到我</span></p><p begin="00:36.724" end="00:39.992" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36036">La, la, la, la, la, la, la, la, la</p><p begin="00:40.572" end="00:43.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36037">聽春風吹春風吹不倒我</p><p begin="00:43.983" end="00:48.848" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36038">(遞隻手就算拖) 沒有這種心跳聲<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但天空并无任何罪过</span></p><p begin="00:47.625" end="00:53.619" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36039">(夜晚黑要熄燈) 直到我興奮後睡覺喪失知覺<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迷失了独属于自己的花语</span></p><p begin="00:54.802" end="01:00.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36040">我最怕聽冧歌每日嘲笑我<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为这是其他人都无法找到的 珍贵之物</span></p><p begin="01:01.005" end="01:08.127" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36041">尤其是Love song冇乜感覺我沒有愛愛愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍贵之物</span></p><p begin="01:09.182" end="01:14.134" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36042">越忙越麻木越怕Love song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再一次出发前去寻找明天</span></p><p begin="01:14.186" end="01:18.006" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36043">越去聽我越得不到愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了不让花瓣就此随风散落</span></p><p begin="01:18.067" end="01:25.626" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36044">我好無情為甚麼誰會可憐我<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将自己紧紧地拥入了怀中</span></p><p begin="01:27.737" end="01:34.219" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36045">呢首歌三分幾我會記得幾咁幼稚</p><p begin="01:34.831" end="01:41.399" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36046">初中篇Josephine陪我吃漢堡通宵點唱</p><p begin="01:41.699" end="01:44.796" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36047">La, la, la, la, la, la, la, la, la<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看起来像是在沉睡的花蕊</span></p><p begin="01:44.806" end="01:48.588" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36048">一打冷鐘散步扮拍拖</p><p begin="01:48.881" end="01:52.148" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36049">La, la, la, la, la, la, la, la, la</p><p begin="01:52.786" end="01:56.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36050">春天冬天等她講喜歡我<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经注意到</span></p><p begin="01:56.174" end="02:01.122" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36051">(遞隻手未有拖) 就有這種心跳聲<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续向前踏出一步的勇气</span></p><p begin="01:59.719" end="02:06.199" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36052">(用耳聽呼吸聲) 就算只得對望就有愛的感覺<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">面对这个充满生机的世界</span></p><p begin="02:06.989" end="02:12.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36053">你最愛聽的歌我在心裏播<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">贴近独属于自己的花语</span></p><p begin="02:13.209" end="02:20.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36054">尤其是Love song每一粒音裏面有愛愛愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就会再次带给我力量</span></p><p begin="02:21.380" end="02:26.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36055">越傻越盲目越愛Love song</p><p begin="02:26.309" end="02:29.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36056">越去聽我越想得到愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和昨天的自己早已做好了约定</span></p><p begin="02:30.148" end="02:37.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36057">愛足全程為甚麼誰也深情過<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没问题 一定会在背后推动我前行</span></p><p begin="02:38.074" end="02:42.382" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36058">年少我聽情歌阿倫情歌<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将自己紧紧地拥入了怀中</span></p><p begin="02:42.525" end="02:45.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36059">抄哂歌詞才下課<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管想要改变  却什么也改变不了</span></p><p begin="02:45.291" end="02:52.359" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36060">跟所有親愛的海濱公園唱情歌冧歌</p><p begin="02:54.317" end="02:59.511" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36061">陪我搭巴士放學散步那一個</p><p begin="03:00.165" end="03:06.303" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36062">一起青春過一閃身走過</p><p begin="03:08.395" end="03:13.687" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36063">我最怕聽冧歌你係都要播<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只好不顾一切地寻觅它的下落</span></p><p begin="03:14.567" end="03:21.357" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36064">尤其是Love song無乜感覺我沒有愛愛愛</p><p begin="03:22.764" end="03:27.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36065">越來越麻木越怕Love song</p><p begin="03:27.602" end="03:31.471" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36066">爛播死播係咁轟炸我<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了不让花瓣就此随风飘落</span></p><p begin="03:31.605" end="03:38.962" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36067">你好無情為甚麼還要催眠我<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将自己紧紧地抱入怀中</span></p></div></body></tt>